␀␀␀␀ !!! Credentials ␀␀␀ saved !!! ␀On Portal Name: ␀␀␀␀With Cloned SSID: ␀␀Error opening file for writing␀␀Error opening file␀␀Error opening credentials file for reading␀␀"ssid":"␀␀␀␀",␀␀"portalOn":␀"page":"␀␀␀␀"connected":␀␀␀␀"ip":"␀␀"clients":␀␀"passwords":␀␀␀␀"stack":"␀␀␀"ram":"␀"battery":"␀"uptime":␀␀␀On␀␀Off␀<table>␀<tr><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr>␀␀␀<tr><td>SSID</td><td><span id='v_ssid'>␀<tr><td>Portal Status</td><td><span id='v_portal'>␀␀<tr><td>Page</td><td><span id='v_page'>␀<tr><td>Connected</td><td><span id='v_connected'>␀␀␀<tr><td>IP Address</td><td><span id='v_ip'>␀<tr><td>Clients Connected</td><td><span id='v_clients'>␀<tr><td>Passwords Count</td><td><span id='v_pwds'>␀␀<tr><td>Stack Left</td><td><span id='v_stack'>␀␀ KB</span></td></tr>␀␀␀␀<tr><td>RAM Usage</td><td><span id='v_ram'>␀<tr><td>Battery Level</td><td><span id='v_battery'>␀%</span></td></tr>␀␀<tr><td>Uptime</td><td><span id='v_uptime'>␀ seconds</span></td></tr>␀␀␀</table>␀␀␀␀<script>
function apply(d){
  var map={v_ssid:d.ssid, v_portal:(d.portalOn?'On':'Off'), v_page:d.page,
            v_connected:(d.connected?'Y':'N'), v_ip:d.ip, v_clients:d.clients,
            v_pwds:d.passwords, v_stack:d.stack+' KB', v_ram:d.ram+' KB',
            v_battery:d.battery+'%', v_uptime:d.uptime+' seconds'};
  for (var k in map){ var el=document.getElementById(k); if(el) el.textContent=map[k]; }
}
function poll(){ fetch('/monitor-status.json',{cache:'no-store'})
  .then(r=>r.json()).then(apply).catch(()=>{});}
poll(); setInterval(poll,2000);
</script>␀Monitor Status␀␀startupSound␀␀␀␀startupImage␀␀␀␀Brightness restored to ␀volume␀␀Volume restored to ␀ledOn␀␀␀soundOn␀randomOn␀␀␀␀Random Startup restored to ␀selectedTheme␀␀␀Selected Theme restored to ␀wifi_ssid␀␀␀wifi_password␀␀␀WiFi SSID restored to ␀␀ssh_user␀␀␀␀WiFi Password restored␀␀ssh_host␀␀␀␀SSH User restored to ␀␀␀ssh_password␀␀␀␀SSH Host restored to ␀␀␀cham_pin␀␀␀␀SSH Password restored␀␀␀Chameleon BLE PIN restored to ␀␀ssh_port␀␀␀␀SSH Port restored to ␀␀␀tcp_host␀␀␀␀TCP host restored to ␀␀␀tcp_port␀␀␀␀TCP Port restored to ␀␀␀baudrate_gps␀␀␀␀GPS Baudrate restored to ␀␀␀gps_pins_mode␀␀␀GPS pins mode: auto (by board)␀␀GPS pins restored: RX54/TX53 (Tab5 swap)␀␀␀␀GPS pins restored: RX53/TX54 (Tab5 Grove A)␀webpassword␀Web password restored␀␀␀discordWebhookURL␀␀␀Discord Webhook URL restored to ␀␀␀␀llm_host␀␀␀␀LLM Host restored to ␀␀␀llm_port␀␀␀␀LLM Port restored to ␀␀␀llm_api_path␀␀␀␀LLM API Path restored to ␀␀␀llm_user␀␀␀␀LLM Username restored to ␀␀␀llm_pass␀␀␀␀LLM Password restored␀␀␀llm_model␀␀␀LLM Model restored to ␀␀llm_max_tokens␀␀LLM Max Tokens restored to ␀evilChatNickname␀␀␀␀Nickname restored to ␀␀␀portal_file␀Portal file restored to ␀␀␀␀portal_file not found on SD, keep: ␀cloned_ssid␀Cloned SSID restored to ␀␀␀␀portal_password␀Portal password restored to ␀␀␀␀portal_ip_sel␀␀␀Captive IP selection restored: ␀startatboot␀StartAtBoot restored to ␀␀␀␀casetostartatboot␀␀␀CaseToStartAtBoot restored to ␀␀cpu_freq␀␀␀␀CPU Frequency restored to ␀␀boot_countdown␀␀Boot countdown restored to ␀ s␀␀Key not found in config, using default for ␀7h30th3r0n3␀7h30th3r0n3.com␀/evilOllama/api/generate␀␀␀␀tinyllama␀␀␀Default Nickname generated: ␀␀␀␀/sites/normal.html␀␀Error opening config.txt␀␀␀␀Config file not found, using default values␀Error opening probes.txt␀␀␀␀Failed to open the original file for reading␀␀␀␀/evil/temp.txt␀␀Failed to open the temp file for writing␀␀␀␀[HS] %s | M1:%d M2:%d M3:%d M4:%d | PMKID:%d | VALID:%d
