␀␀{"clients":␀,"uploads":␀,"downloads":␀␀␀,"notes":␀␀␀,"bytesIn":␀,"bytesOut":␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>␀␀<title>WiFi Dead Drop</title>␀␀␀body{background:#111;color:#ddd;font-family:Consolas,monospace;text-align:center;margin:0;padding:0;}␀␀␀.container{max-width:500px;margin:40px auto;padding:20px;}␀␀h2{color:#0ff;margin-bottom:10px;text-shadow:0 0 6px #0ff;}␀h3{color:#0ff;margin-top:30px;}␀p{font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#aaa;}␀␀␀.block{width:100%;margin:8px 0;box-sizing:border-box;}␀␀input,textarea,button{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #0ff;background:#111;color:#0ff;font-family:Consolas,monospace;font-size:14px;display:block;}␀␀␀␀textarea{resize:vertical;}␀␀button{cursor:pointer;transition:all 0.2s;}button:hover{background:#0ff;color:#111;}␀␀␀␀progress{width:100%;height:14px;margin:8px 0;}␀␀#status{font-size:13px;margin-top:6px;color:#aaa;}␀␀a{color:#0ff;text-decoration:none;}a:hover{text-decoration:underline;}␀␀@media(max-width:600px){.container{max-width:100%;margin:0;padding:15px;}}␀␀</style></head><body>␀␀␀<div class='container'>␀<h2>WiFi Dead Drop</h2>␀<p>Welcome to the underground dead drop. Share files or leave notes.</p>␀␀␀␀<h3>Upload a File</h3>␀␀<input id='f' class='block' type='file'>␀␀␀␀<button class='block' onclick='up()'>Upload</button>␀␀␀␀<progress id='prog' value='0' max='100' style='display:none'></progress>␀␀␀␀<div id='status'></div>␀<h3>Leave a Note</h3>␀␀␀<form method='post' action='/dd-note'>␀␀<textarea class='block' name='msg' rows='3' maxlength='1024' placeholder='Drop your message here...'></textarea>␀␀␀␀<button class='block' type='submit'>Publish</button></form>␀<p style='margin-top:20px'><a href='/dd-list'>&#128193; View Deposits</a></p>␀␀␀<hr style='border:0;border-top:1px solid #333;margin:20px 0'>␀␀␀<small>Connected to <span style='color:#0ff'>␀␀␀</span></small>␀function human(x){if(x<1024)return x+' B';if(x<1048576)return(x/1024).toFixed(1)+' KB';if(x<1073741824)return(x/1048576).toFixed(1)+' MB';return(x/1073741824).toFixed(1)+' GB';}␀␀␀function up(){␀␀ var f=document.getElementById('f').files[0];␀␀␀ if(!f){alert('Select a file');return;}␀ var p=document.getElementById('prog');␀ var s=document.getElementById('status');␀␀␀ p.style.display='block';p.value=0;s.textContent='Starting upload...';␀␀ var start=Date.now();␀␀ var xhr=new XMLHttpRequest();xhr.open('POST','/dd-upload',true);␀␀␀ xhr.upload.onprogress=function(e){␀   if(e.lengthComputable){␀␀     var percent=Math.floor((e.loaded/e.total)*100);␀␀␀␀     var elapsed=(Date.now()-start)/1000;␀␀␀     var speed=(e.loaded/1024/elapsed).toFixed(1);␀␀     p.value=percent;␀␀␀     s.textContent='Uploading '+percent+'% ('+human(e.loaded)+' / '+human(e.total)+', '+speed+' KB/s)';␀   }␀␀␀␀ };␀ xhr.onload=function(){s.textContent='Upload complete';window.location='/dd-list';};␀␀␀␀ xhr.onerror=function(){s.textContent='Upload failed';};␀␀␀␀ var form=new FormData();form.append('data',f,f.name);xhr.send(form);␀␀␀</div></body></html>␀␀␀␀<html><head><title>Success</title></head><body>Success</body></html>␀␀␀␀SD not ready␀␀␀␀<!doctype html><html><head><meta charset='utf-8'>␀␀␀<meta name='viewport' content='width=device-width,initial-scale=1'>␀<title>Deposits</title><style>␀␀body{background:#0a0a0a;color:#e0e0e0;font-family:monospace;margin:20px;}␀␀␀h3{color:#ff00aa;text-shadow:0 0 8px #ff00aa;}␀␀a{color:#00b7ff;text-decoration:none;}a:hover{text-shadow:0 0 6px #00b7ff;}␀table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;margin-top:10px;}␀th,td{text-align:left;padding:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #222;}␀␀␀␀th{color:#0ff;font-size:14px;} td{font-size:13px;}␀␀<h3>ğŸ“‚ Uploaded Files</h3>␀␀␀␀<table><tr><th>Name</th><th>Size</th></tr>␀␀ GB␀ MB␀ KB␀<tr><td><a href='/dd-get?f=␀</a></td><td>␀␀␀</table><p><a href='/'>â¬… Back</a></p></body></html>␀␀␀Missing f␀␀␀Failed to open file␀attachment; filename="␀␀"; filename*=UTF-8''␀␀␀␀/evil/FindMyEvil_keys.txt␀␀␀[FM-TX] SD: file %s not found
