rt).␀␀␀Channel / DM Spoof␀␀Post on the Public channel as any spoofed sender name, or DM a sniffed node. Abuses the unauthenticated GRP_TXT sender string.␀␀Spoof a sender name on the Public channel (from a sniffed node or typed by hand).␀␀␀GhostSwarm (auto)␀␀␀Churn of ephemeral identities: announce + a few channel messages, then regenerate and repeat.␀␀␀DarkMirror (auto)␀␀␀Listen for Public channel GRP_TXT, then replay them with a live timestamp (skips MeshCore dedup).␀␀␀Regen Identity␀␀Generate a fresh Ed25519 keypair + name (reset) for cost-free Sybil identities.␀Recon / Sniffer␀Passive RX in real time: list every advert/node heard (prefix, type C/R/M, name, RSSI, age). Scroll with ;/. Receive only.␀␀Preset / Freq / BW / SF / CR / TxPwr. Review and edit before any TX.␀␀␀␀About PoisonCore␀␀␀␀MeshCore LoRa pentest PoC by Teno,
sibling of PoisonMesh.
HW: Cardputer ADV + Cap LoRa-1262
(SX1262), sync word 0x12.
GHSA draft: unauth sender identity
+ weak replay (CWE-345/290/294).
Authorized use only.␀␀Live Nodes␀␀Passive real-time list of Meshtastic nodes heard on the mesh: name, RSSI, age, GPS flag. Receive only, no injection.␀␀␀␀Mass injection of phantom nodes with random names and hardware ids to pollute the mesh node DB.␀Periodic injection of nodes at random GPS positions. Toggle ON / OFF.␀␀␀Rename an existing node, choosing an arbitrary board / hardware model.␀␀Relocate a target node to a preset destination (Malvinas, Egypt, Australia, Rome).␀␀Auto-relocate every discovered node, renaming each one as 'Moved'.␀␀Impersonate a node to send text messages, with optional repeat count.␀␀␀CVE-2025-55293: wipe a target node's stored public key, breaking PKI and enabling identity spoofing.␀␀␀␀Continuous impersonation of random nodes with random text. Toggle ON / OFF, random 2-6 s delay.␀Persistent phantom node (manual name + X25519 key derived from the node id) to spoof messages for the whole session.␀␀␀␀LoRa region + modem preset. Regions US..JP; presets ShortTurbo..VeryLongSlow (default LongFast).
Channel frequency is derived from region + preset and applied to the SX1262.␀␀␀About PoisonMesh␀␀␀␀Meshtastic LoRa pentest PoC by Teno.
HW: Cardputer ADV + Cap LoRa-1262
(SX1262, 850-960 MHz).
